- Settings → under the template choice: "Rechnungsdesign" with live preview:
  6 swatches + own colour, logo left/centre/right and small/medium/large,
  a line under the company details, footer text, reset. Defaults keep both
  templates exactly as before. Stored in state.invoiceDesign (+ backup).
- Fix: invoices fell back to Smartordi OG's address, e-mail, phone and FN, and
  the footer was hard-coded to Smartordi OG. Now only the customer's own data;
  default footer = thanks + company name, address, UID.
- CHANGES_FOR_BACKEND.md: step 6.

